    "created_at": "2022-02-12T00:16:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-12T00:16:45Z",
    "body": "I mean, we can create a test that asserts `<style media=\"print\">` doesn't block rendering. This is doable.\r\n\r\nBut even if a browser fails it, it's still spec-comformant. So what's the point of adding such a test?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
