    "created_at": "2022-02-12T00:30:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-12T00:30:04Z",
    "body": "I see, the distinction is that script-blocking is required by the spec but render-blocking is not.\r\n\r\nI think such tests would still be useful to browsers. But I guess they are not required. I'll merge after the weekend unless someone else chimes in to contradict me.",
